# Hand-written from the sources: the types and callables each file declares,
# as `class|function <name>@<path relative to this directory>`. An interface,
# a record and a struct are types. Properties, fields and namespaces are not
# part of the contract. A partial class is declared once per file that holds
# a part; an overload is one entry per signature.
